Subject: [PATCH] NV309-d: ngan sach 1200s cho engine (a)/(b)/(c)/(d) + Grok
 thu lai 1 lan qua lam moi truoc khi xoay
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- app/khoi_phuc_phien.py: NGAN_SACH_ABCD_GIAY = 1200 (mau c2a
  _RECOVER_BUDGET_S); het thi bo tang (b), van xoay (c) roi (d) voi ly do
  rieng; kiem o bien tang, khong cat giua luot goi tang.
- modules/grok-web/module.py: _luong_van_ban thu lai 1 lan qua tang (a)
  lam_moi_phien khi loi phien truoc khi co chu (mau c2a stream_chat
  range(2) + lam_moi(p)); loi khong phai phien xoay ngay; da co chu thi
  dung nhu cu.
- Thu tu uu tien CAU HINH DUOC chua lam: Q2 cua NV309 chua co cau tra loi
  (xem bao cao nv309-d-bao-cao.md) — cho chu may.
- Test do-truoc-xanh-sau (mock, khong mang that): 5 test moi grok-web +
  1 test moi nv88; cap nhat 1 test xoay cu theo hanh vi moi.
